{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfamLgVSmb3DyReshc5o2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"{\"concept\":{\"promise\":\"A teaching book that shows believers what they already inherited in Christ — resurrection life, union with the Father, unconditional love and usable spiritual authority — and how to practice it daily.\",\"subject\":\"A multi-session teaching corpus expounding Hebrews 2, John 17, Colossians 3, Malachi and related texts, joined to personal testimony of healing, resurrection and providence.\",\"journey\":\"From inherited habit, tradition and fear of death, through scriptural exposition of destroyed death and granted union, into a disciplined practice of mind, prayer and ministry, ending in testimony and prophetic vision.\",\"progression\":\"Diagnosis of inherited religion → doctrinal foundation (resurrection life, offices, union) → interior anatomy and mental discipline → practice and testimony → corporate vision.\"},\"titles\":[{\"t\":\"Flesh and Bone\",\"why\":\"Anchors the central corrective about physical resurrection and real inheritance.\"},{\"t\":\"Already Yours\",\"why\":\"Captures the recurring claim that life, love, power and grace are already given.\"},{\"t\":\"The Life You Already Inherited\",\"why\":\"Explicit, pastoral, matches teaching audience.\"},{\"t\":\"One With the Father\",\"why\":\"Foregrounds the John 17 spine of the corpus.\"}],\"pick\":2,\"subtitle\":\"Resurrection life, union with God, and the practice of spiritual authority\",\"angle\":\"Treat the corpus as a sustained correction: against legalism, rapture-fixation, performance ministry and fear of death, replaced by inheritance already granted and practiced.\",\"reader\":\"Local congregations, retreat attendees, pastors and ministers receiving in-person Bible teaching and testimony.\",\"strategy\":\"Group the scattered sessions by doctrinal and practical theme rather than chronology; place exposition before interior discipline, discipline before testimony, and reserve testimony chapters as demonstration of the earlier teaching. Uncertainties are flagged in situ, never resolved.\",\"chapters\":[{\"h\":\"c1\",\"t\":\"Unlearning What Was Handed Down\",\"p\":\"Open with the diagnosis: inherited custom and secondhand information replacing direct hearing from God.\",\"sum\":\"Direct hearing, bodily discipline, cultural food habits, tradition versus faith, ambition for long life.\",\"top\":[\"TOP001\",\"TOP002\",\"TOP003\",\"TOP004\",\"TOP008\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Cluster the retreat-opening practical material with the tradition-versus-faith argument it serves.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c1s1\",\"t\":\"Hearing Him Directly\",\"p\":\"Establish the governing complaint about reliance on external information.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA001\",\"IDEA005\"],\"top\":[\"TOP008\"]},{\"h\":\"c1s2\",\"t\":\"Body, Food and Inherited Habit\",\"p\":\"Use retreat discipline and food custom as the concrete entry point.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA002\",\"IDEA003\",\"IDEA004\",\"IDEA006\"],\"x\":[\"EX001\",\"EX002\"],\"ref\":[\"REF001\"],\"top\":[\"TOP001\",\"TOP002\",\"TOP003\"]},{\"h\":\"c1s3\",\"t\":\"Tradition Cannot Be Accepted\",\"p\":\"State the doctrinal principle that only Christ is accepted, not custom or condition.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA022\",\"IDEA023\",\"IDEA024\"],\"ref\":[\"REF003\"],\"top\":[\"TOP008\"]},{\"h\":\"c1s4\",\"t\":\"The Question of Long Life\",\"p\":\"Introduce longevity and the tree of life as an unresolved ambition that frames the book.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA007\",\"IDEA008\",\"IDEA020\"],\"top\":[\"TOP004\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c2\",\"t\":\"Flesh and Bone: The Resurrection You Inherit\",\"p\":\"Lay the central doctrinal correction about physical resurrection and restored sonship.\",\"sum\":\"Flesh and bone inheritance, sons of men becoming sons of God, Adam's failure and Christ's intercession, life already possessed.\",\"top\":[\"TOP005\",\"TOP006\",\"TOP007\",\"TOP011\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"REORDER\",\"n\":\"Doctrine of resurrection placed before the Hebrews 2 session that argues for it.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c2s1\",\"t\":\"Spirits Have No Flesh and Bone\",\"p\":\"Present the corrective against die-well preaching and positional-only readings.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA009\",\"IDEA010\",\"IDEA011\",\"IDEA012\"],\"u\":[\"UNC001\"],\"top\":[\"TOP005\"]},{\"h\":\"c2s2\",\"t\":\"From Sons of Men to Sons of God\",\"p\":\"Trace the fall of sonship and its restoration in Christ.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA013\",\"IDEA014\",\"IDEA019\",\"IDEA021\"],\"ref\":[\"REF002\"],\"u\":[\"UNC003\"],\"top\":[\"TOP006\",\"TOP004\"]},{\"h\":\"c2s3\",\"t\":\"The Silence of Adam, the Prayer of Christ\",\"p\":\"Contrast Adam's failure to intercede with Christ's intercession for the church.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA015\",\"IDEA016\",\"IDEA017\",\"IDEA018\"],\"top\":[\"TOP007\"]},{\"h\":\"c2s4\",\"t\":\"Life Older, Better, Everlasting\",\"p\":\"Close the doctrinal claim: eternal life already possessed, persecution notwithstanding.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA036\",\"IDEA037\",\"IDEA039\"],\"top\":[\"TOP011\",\"TOP009\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c3\",\"t\":\"Hebrews 2: Death Already Destroyed\",\"p\":\"Work the group exposition of Hebrews 2 and its consequences for preaching and fear.\",\"sum\":\"Live reading of Hebrews 2, translation dispute, African demonic emphasis, power already indwelling, accountability for the gospel preached.\",\"top\":[\"TOP009\",\"TOP010\",\"TOP008\",\"TOP030\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"SPLIT_TOPIC\",\"n\":\"Separate the text exposition from the cultural-context discussion it provoked.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c3s1\",\"t\":\"Reading the Text Together\",\"p\":\"Carry the group reading and the contested rendering without resolving it.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA032\",\"IDEA033\",\"IDEA035\"],\"x\":[\"EX004\"],\"ref\":[\"REF007\",\"REF008\"],\"u\":[\"UNC005\"],\"top\":[\"TOP009\"]},{\"h\":\"c3s2\",\"t\":\"The Devil Men Still Boast Of\",\"p\":\"Address the contrast between global and African experience of the demonic.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA030\",\"IDEA031\",\"IDEA034\"],\"x\":[\"EX003\",\"EX005\"],\"u\":[\"UNC004\"],\"top\":[\"TOP010\"]},{\"h\":\"c3s3\",\"t\":\"The Power Is Already Inside\",\"p\":\"Move from spectator admiration of a powerful Christ to participation.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA025\",\"IDEA026\",\"IDEA027\",\"IDEA028\",\"IDEA029\"],\"ref\":[\"REF005\",\"REF004\"],\"top\":[\"TOP008\"]},{\"h\":\"c3s4\",\"t\":\"Which Gospel Will You Preach?\",\"p\":\"Turn the exposition into ministerial accountability and new boldness in prayer.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA038\",\"IDEA098\",\"IDEA099\"],\"top\":[\"TOP011\",\"TOP030\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c4\",\"t\":\"Priest, Prophet, King\",\"p\":\"Set out the sacred offices, the ordered priesthood, and the warnings attached to it.\",\"sum\":\"Shadow and fulfillment, three offices, universal versus ordered priesthood, Melchizedek, Malachi's warning, not despising the calling.\",\"top\":[\"TOP013\",\"TOP014\",\"TOP015\",\"TOP016\",\"TOP017\",\"TOP018\",\"TOP019\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Consolidate all office/authority material scattered across sessions.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c4s1\",\"t\":\"The Shadow and the Reality\",\"p\":\"Frame Old Testament encounter as prefiguration.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA041\",\"IDEA042\",\"IDEA043\"],\"top\":[\"TOP013\"]},{\"h\":\"c4s2\",\"t\":\"Three Sacred Offices\",\"p\":\"Define the offices and the distinction between common and ordered priesthood.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA044\",\"IDEA045\",\"IDEA046\",\"IDEA047\",\"IDEA055\"],\"ref\":[\"REF013\"],\"top\":[\"TOP014\",\"TOP015\"]},{\"h\":\"c4s3\",\"t\":\"Recognizing Who Stands Before You\",\"p\":\"Use Melchizedek to teach discernment of spiritual authority.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA048\",\"IDEA049\",\"IDEA050\"],\"x\":[\"EX006\"],\"top\":[\"TOP016\"]},{\"h\":\"c4s4\",\"t\":\"Malachi's Warning to the Priests\",\"p\":\"Carry the covenant of life and peace and the curse on an unguarded blessing.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA051\",\"IDEA052\",\"IDEA053\",\"IDEA054\"],\"ref\":[\"REF012\"],\"u\":[\"UNC006\"],\"top\":[\"TOP017\"]},{\"h\":\"c4s5\",\"t\":\"Let No One Despise the Calling\",\"p\":\"Correct false modesty and strain for recognition among ministers.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA056\",\"IDEA057\",\"IDEA058\",\"IDEA059\"],\"x\":[\"EX007\"],\"ref\":[\"REF011\"],\"top\":[\"TOP018\",\"TOP019\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c5\",\"t\":\"Access, Not Achievement\",\"p\":\"Dismantle condition-based access to God: anointing, offering, worship, fasting.\",\"sum\":\"Activating the anointing, heart behind sacrifice, worship as fellowship, simplicity of receiving power, purpose and limits of fasting.\",\"top\":[\"TOP020\",\"TOP021\",\"TOP022\",\"TOP023\",\"TOP024\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"CONNECT\",\"n\":\"Link the fasting critique back to the tradition-versus-faith argument of Chapter 1.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c5s1\",\"t\":\"Anointed but Not Activated\",\"p\":\"Distinguish possessing a blessing from accessing it.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA060\",\"IDEA061\",\"IDEA062\"],\"x\":[\"EX008\"],\"u\":[\"UNC007\"],\"top\":[\"TOP020\"]},{\"h\":\"c5s2\",\"t\":\"The Heart Behind the Offering\",\"p\":\"Present heart attitude as decisive for sacrifice.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA063\",\"IDEA064\"],\"ref\":[\"REF014\",\"REF048\"],\"top\":[\"TOP021\"]},{\"h\":\"c5s3\",\"t\":\"Worship as Fellowship\",\"p\":\"Separate performative expression from genuine encounter.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA065\",\"IDEA066\",\"IDEA067\",\"IDEA068\"],\"x\":[\"EX009\"],\"ref\":[\"REF015\"],\"top\":[\"TOP022\"]},{\"h\":\"c5s4\",\"t\":\"Nothing Added to What He Said\",\"p\":\"Attack manufactured suffering doctrines and formulas for power.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA069\",\"IDEA070\",\"IDEA071\",\"IDEA072\",\"IDEA073\"],\"x\":[\"EX010\"],\"u\":[\"UNC009\"],\"top\":[\"TOP023\"]},{\"h\":\"c5s5\",\"t\":\"What Fasting Is Actually For\",\"p\":\"Give fasting its real profit without making it a condition or a method.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA074\",\"IDEA075\",\"IDEA076\",\"IDEA077\"],\"x\":[\"EX011\",\"EX012\"],\"ref\":[\"REF018\",\"REF019\"],\"top\":[\"TOP024\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c6\",\"t\":\"That They May Be One\",\"p\":\"Make John 17 the structural spine: union, glory, preservation, and the critique of rapture-centered focus.\",\"sum\":\"Jesus' prayer, sanctification, unity and glory, honesty about one's stand, rapture critique, overflow of communion, the Holy Spirit as person, the promised dimension, sensitivity to spiritual levels.\",\"top\":[\"TOP025\",\"TOP026\",\"TOP027\",\"TOP028\",\"TOP029\",\"TOP031\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Gather all John 17 material from separate sessions into one chapter.\"},{\"k\":\"REORDER\",\"n\":\"Place the rapture critique inside the John 17 chapter as its direct corollary.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c6s1\",\"t\":\"The Prayer of Dependence\",\"p\":\"Present Jesus' union with the Father and his prayer for preservation and sanctification.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA078\",\"IDEA079\",\"IDEA080\",\"IDEA089\",\"IDEA090\"],\"ref\":[\"REF009\",\"REF020\"],\"top\":[\"TOP025\",\"TOP026\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s2\",\"t\":\"The Same Glory\",\"p\":\"Expound unity of essence and glory given to believers.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA091\",\"IDEA092\",\"IDEA093\",\"IDEA094\"],\"top\":[\"TOP028\",\"TOP029\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s3\",\"t\":\"Be Factual About Where You Stand\",\"p\":\"Correct exaggerated faith declarations and account for stages of growth.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA095\",\"IDEA096\",\"IDEA097\"],\"top\":[\"TOP029\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s4\",\"t\":\"Not Waiting, Working\",\"p\":\"Deliver the critique of rapture-centered eschatology and its passivity.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA081\",\"IDEA082\",\"IDEA083\",\"IDEA084\",\"IDEA085\",\"IDEA086\",\"IDEA087\",\"IDEA088\"],\"ref\":[\"REF021\",\"REF022\"],\"top\":[\"TOP027\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s5\",\"t\":\"Speech from Overflow\",\"p\":\"Contrast rehearsed formulas with authority flowing from communion.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA105\",\"IDEA106\",\"IDEA107\",\"IDEA108\"],\"x\":[\"EX016\"],\"top\":[\"TOP028\",\"TOP034\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s6\",\"t\":\"Knowing the Spirit, Not Only the Gifts\",\"p\":\"Shift emphasis from isolated gifts to relationship and vessel-cooperation.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA109\",\"IDEA110\",\"IDEA111\",\"IDEA112\",\"IDEA113\"],\"ref\":[\"REF023\"],\"top\":[\"TOP028\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s7\",\"t\":\"The Key of Life\",\"p\":\"Carry the promised dimension where the supernatural feels natural, and the simple confession it yields.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA124\",\"IDEA125\",\"IDEA126\",\"IDEA127\"],\"ref\":[\"REF024\"],\"top\":[\"TOP026\"]},{\"h\":\"c6s8\",\"t\":\"Knowing Where People Are\",\"p\":\"Balance bold authority with pastoral sensitivity to differing spiritual levels.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA100\",\"IDEA101\",\"IDEA102\",\"IDEA103\",\"IDEA104\"],\"x\":[\"EX013\",\"EX014\",\"EX015\"],\"u\":[\"UNC010\"],\"top\":[\"TOP031\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c7\",\"t\":\"Loved Exactly as Jesus Is Loved\",\"p\":\"Hold the unconditional love text against conditions preachers add, then show God's use of flawed people.\",\"sum\":\"John 17:23 on divine love, illegitimate conditions, goodness producing purity, imperfect biblical figures carrying great power.\",\"top\":[\"TOP032\",\"TOP033\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"CONNECT\",\"n\":\"Tie unconditional love directly to the flawed-vessel argument.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c7s1\",\"t\":\"No Condition in the Text\",\"p\":\"Expound the love claim and the transformation it produces.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA114\",\"IDEA115\",\"IDEA116\"],\"top\":[\"TOP032\"]},{\"h\":\"c7s2\",\"t\":\"Flawed and Still Used\",\"p\":\"Assemble the biblical cases of imperfect figures carrying power.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA117\",\"IDEA118\",\"IDEA119\",\"IDEA120\",\"IDEA121\",\"IDEA122\",\"IDEA123\"],\"x\":[\"EX017\",\"EX018\",\"EX019\"],\"ref\":[\"REF025\"],\"u\":[\"UNC011\",\"UNC012\"],\"top\":[\"TOP033\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c8\",\"t\":\"Set Your Mind Above\",\"p\":\"Move from doctrine to the first practical discipline: fixing the mind on heavenly reality.\",\"sum\":\"Colossians 3 practice, Philippians 4:8 in ordinary life, mind as battlefield, completeness under the Head.\",\"top\":[\"TOP034\",\"TOP035\",\"TOP036\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"REORDER\",\"n\":\"Begin the practice half of the book with the mind discipline.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c8s1\",\"t\":\"Fixing the Affections\",\"p\":\"Give the nightly, deliberate practice of conscious fellowship and anchored focus.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA128\",\"IDEA129\",\"IDEA130\",\"IDEA131\",\"IDEA132\"],\"x\":[\"EX020\"],\"ref\":[\"REF026\",\"REF027\"],\"top\":[\"TOP034\"]},{\"h\":\"c8s2\",\"t\":\"Selecting Your Thoughts\",\"p\":\"Apply Philippians 4:8 to ordinary movement and establish the mind as battlefield.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA133\",\"IDEA134\",\"IDEA135\"],\"x\":[\"EX021\"],\"top\":[\"TOP034\",\"TOP035\"]},{\"h\":\"c8s3\",\"t\":\"Complete in the Head\",\"p\":\"Argue the contradiction between a powerful Head and a sick, poor body.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA136\",\"IDEA137\",\"IDEA138\"],\"ref\":[\"REF028\",\"REF029\"],\"top\":[\"TOP036\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c9\",\"t\":\"Laws You Gave Yourself\",\"p\":\"Expose self-imposed legalism from imitation and recover personal uniqueness before God.\",\"sum\":\"Imitation-born rules, individuality of spiritual experience, God's intimate knowledge, long process behind testimonies, historical cost of discipleship and coerced religion.\",\"top\":[\"TOP037\",\"TOP038\",\"TOP039\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Join the self-imposed-law teaching with the historical-cost material that corrects easy modern readings.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c9s1\",\"t\":\"When Admiration Becomes Law\",\"p\":\"Show how imitation of a model creates private legalism.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA139\",\"IDEA140\",\"IDEA141\",\"IDEA142\"],\"x\":[\"EX022\"],\"top\":[\"TOP037\"]},{\"h\":\"c9s2\",\"t\":\"He Knows How He Made You\",\"p\":\"Affirm deliberate individual making and the long process behind breakthrough.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA143\",\"IDEA144\",\"IDEA145\",\"IDEA151\",\"IDEA152\"],\"top\":[\"TOP037\"]},{\"h\":\"c9s3\",\"t\":\"The Real Cost of the Doctrine\",\"p\":\"Restore the occupied, coercive context of Jesus' teaching and of church history.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA146\",\"IDEA147\",\"IDEA148\",\"IDEA149\",\"IDEA150\"],\"x\":[\"EX023\",\"EX024\",\"EX025\",\"EX026\"],\"top\":[\"TOP038\",\"TOP039\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c10\",\"t\":\"Spirit, Soul and Body\",\"p\":\"Give the anatomy that the practice chapters depend on.\",\"sum\":\"Tripartite man, conscience, soul as hub, the dying that began at the Fall, growth into sonship, the devil's nature and contested identifications.\",\"top\":[\"TOP040\",\"TOP041\",\"TOP042\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"SPLIT_TOPIC\",\"n\":\"Separate structural anatomy from the Fall narrative and from the Lucifer/devil distinction.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c10s1\",\"t\":\"The Three-Part Man\",\"p\":\"Define spirit, soul and body and the soul's channeling function.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA153\",\"IDEA155\",\"IDEA156\",\"IDEA157\",\"IDEA158\"],\"u\":[\"UNC016\"],\"top\":[\"TOP040\"]},{\"h\":\"c10s2\",\"t\":\"In Dying You Shall Die\",\"p\":\"Present the Fall as progressive spiritual decay and the growth back into sonship.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA154\",\"IDEA159\",\"IDEA160\",\"IDEA161\",\"IDEA162\"],\"ref\":[\"REF030\"],\"u\":[\"UNC017\"],\"top\":[\"TOP041\"]},{\"h\":\"c10s3\",\"t\":\"Fighting What Does Not Exist\",\"p\":\"Carry the asserted distinction between Lucifer, Satan and the devil without resolving it.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA163\",\"IDEA164\",\"IDEA165\"],\"ref\":[\"REF031\"],\"u\":[\"UNC018\"],\"top\":[\"TOP041\"]},{\"h\":\"c10s4\",\"t\":\"Heart, Soul and Mind\",\"p\":\"Locate the development work in the soul, not the already-complete spirit.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA166\",\"IDEA183\",\"IDEA187\"],\"ref\":[\"REF032\"],\"top\":[\"TOP042\",\"TOP046\",\"TOP048\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c11\",\"t\":\"Reasonings and Strongholds\",\"p\":\"Distinguish natural knowledge from revelation and define the believer's real combat.\",\"sum\":\"Simplicity in Christ, flesh-and-blood knowledge, relevance to one's society, pastoral discernment in miracle settings, weapons and captive thoughts.\",\"top\":[\"TOP043\",\"TOP044\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"CONNECT\",\"n\":\"Carry the mind-as-battlefield claim from Chapter 8 into explicit warfare terms.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c11s1\",\"t\":\"The Simplicity That Is in Christ\",\"p\":\"Warn against deception away from simplicity and model meekness with authority.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA167\",\"IDEA168\",\"IDEA169\"],\"ref\":[\"REF033\",\"REF034\"],\"top\":[\"TOP043\"]},{\"h\":\"c11s2\",\"t\":\"Flesh-and-Blood Knowledge\",\"p\":\"Distinguish revelation from natural knowledge while demanding relevance.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA170\",\"IDEA171\",\"IDEA172\"],\"x\":[\"EX027\",\"EX028\"],\"ref\":[\"REF035\"],\"top\":[\"TOP043\"]},{\"h\":\"c11s3\",\"t\":\"Feed Them Afterward\",\"p\":\"Insist on physical care and discernment alongside spiritual acts.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA173\",\"IDEA174\"],\"x\":[\"EX029\"],\"top\":[\"TOP043\"]},{\"h\":\"c11s4\",\"t\":\"Bringing Every Thought Captive\",\"p\":\"Define the combat as reasonings and insist on guarding the barrier of the mind.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA175\",\"IDEA176\",\"IDEA177\",\"IDEA178\"],\"u\":[\"UNC022\"],\"top\":[\"TOP044\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c12\",\"t\":\"Prayer Corrected\",\"p\":\"Reform prayer practice: tongues rightly used, correction received, hunger as the condition.\",\"sum\":\"Misused tongues, refreshment through tongues, the speaker's correction, sincerity without knowledge, hunger and thirst as anchor.\",\"top\":[\"TOP045\",\"TOP057\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Collect prayer/tongues material scattered across several sessions.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c12s1\",\"t\":\"Bavardage Is Not Prayer\",\"p\":\"Expose all-night undiscerning tongues and unpracticed instruction.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA179\",\"IDEA182\",\"IDEA186\"],\"top\":[\"TOP045\"]},{\"h\":\"c12s2\",\"t\":\"The Refreshing\",\"p\":\"Present the stated primary benefit of tongues and its short practical use.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA180\",\"IDEA181\",\"IDEA237\"],\"ref\":[\"REF036\",\"REF044\",\"REF047\",\"REF037\",\"REF038\"],\"u\":[\"UNC029\"],\"top\":[\"TOP045\",\"TOP057\"]},{\"h\":\"c12s3\",\"t\":\"He Told Me I Was Tired\",\"p\":\"Carry the personal correction and the need to adjust sincere but mistaken practice.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA184\",\"IDEA185\",\"IDEA238\"],\"x\":[\"EX030\"],\"top\":[\"TOP045\",\"TOP057\"]},{\"h\":\"c12s4\",\"t\":\"Pouring on the Thirsty\",\"p\":\"Establish hunger as the anchor condition for receiving more.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA212\",\"IDEA213\"],\"ref\":[\"REF042\",\"REF043\"],\"top\":[\"TOP045\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c13\",\"t\":\"The Renewed Mind and the Hidden Faculty\",\"p\":\"Teach renewal of the mind and imagination as the method of lasting communion.\",\"sum\":\"Living sacrifice through renewal, the brain as instrument, imagination as God-given faculty, bringing Jesus into thought, trained meditation.\",\"top\":[\"TOP046\",\"TOP047\",\"TOP048\",\"TOP057\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"SPLIT_TOPIC\",\"n\":\"Separate the faculty teaching from its prayer application and from meditation habits.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c13s1\",\"t\":\"Renewal Is Not Force\",\"p\":\"Locate renewal in deliberate thought rather than power or spirit alone.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA188\",\"IDEA189\",\"IDEA190\"],\"ref\":[\"REF039\"],\"top\":[\"TOP046\"]},{\"h\":\"c13s2\",\"t\":\"The Power the Church Did Not Teach\",\"p\":\"Present imagination as a neglected God-given faculty and compare other traditions' use of it.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA191\",\"IDEA192\",\"IDEA193\",\"IDEA194\",\"IDEA197\",\"IDEA198\",\"IDEA199\"],\"x\":[\"EX031\"],\"ref\":[\"REF040\"],\"u\":[\"UNC023\"],\"top\":[\"TOP047\"]},{\"h\":\"c13s3\",\"t\":\"Bring Jesus Into the Thought\",\"p\":\"Apply imagination to prayer so mind and spirit agree.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA195\",\"IDEA196\",\"IDEA200\",\"IDEA201\",\"IDEA202\",\"IDEA203\",\"IDEA204\",\"IDEA205\",\"IDEA206\"],\"top\":[\"TOP046\",\"TOP047\",\"TOP048\"]},{\"h\":\"c13s4\",\"t\":\"Training the Wandering Mind\",\"p\":\"Give the habits of compartmentalizing, pre-sleep focus and graduated growth.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA239\",\"IDEA240\",\"IDEA241\",\"IDEA242\",\"IDEA245\"],\"x\":[\"EX038\",\"EX040\"],\"top\":[\"TOP057\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c14\",\"t\":\"Operating What You Have\",\"p\":\"Move into the exercise of power: abnormal faith, short prayer, hands, holiness, effortless gifts.\",\"sum\":\"Abnormal acts and short prayers, humility about untested doctrine, hands as doorways, holiness and simple faith, gifts flowing without struggle.\",\"top\":[\"TOP049\",\"TOP050\",\"TOP051\",\"TOP052\",\"TOP053\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Join the practice of faith with the teaching on hands, holiness and gifts.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c14s1\",\"t\":\"Abnormal Faith, Short Prayers\",\"p\":\"Teach the short confident prayer and acting without knowing the outcome.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA207\",\"IDEA208\",\"IDEA209\",\"IDEA210\",\"IDEA211\"],\"x\":[\"EX032\",\"EX033\",\"EX034\"],\"u\":[\"UNC024\"],\"top\":[\"TOP049\",\"TOP050\"]},{\"h\":\"c14s2\",\"t\":\"Hands as Doorways\",\"p\":\"Carry the torn-veil teaching and the two corroborating visions.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA214\",\"IDEA215\",\"IDEA216\"],\"x\":[\"EX035\",\"EX036\"],\"ref\":[\"REF017\"],\"u\":[\"UNC025\"],\"top\":[\"TOP051\"]},{\"h\":\"c14s3\",\"t\":\"A Holy Man Lacks Nothing\",\"p\":\"Connect inner purity to unobstructed authority and simple faith for healing.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA217\",\"IDEA218\",\"IDEA219\"],\"top\":[\"TOP052\"]},{\"h\":\"c14s4\",\"t\":\"Without Struggle\",\"p\":\"Describe mature operation of the gifts as overflow rather than effort.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA220\",\"IDEA221\",\"IDEA222\",\"IDEA223\"],\"top\":[\"TOP053\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c15\",\"t\":\"Grace Barely Touched\",\"p\":\"Show how much is already given and how believers testify to discovering it.\",\"sum\":\"Grace exceeding imagination, Moses contrasted with indwelling, retreat testimonies, healing already accomplished, progressive understanding, the sower as stages of one life.\",\"top\":[\"TOP055\",\"TOP056\",\"TOP058\",\"TOP059\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"CONNECT\",\"n\":\"Place firsthand testimonies immediately after the grace teaching they illustrate.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c15s1\",\"t\":\"More Than We Have Used\",\"p\":\"Expound grace and truth through Jesus against law through Moses.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA231\",\"IDEA232\",\"IDEA233\",\"IDEA234\",\"IDEA235\",\"IDEA236\"],\"ref\":[\"REF045\",\"REF046\"],\"top\":[\"TOP056\"]},{\"h\":\"c15s2\",\"t\":\"What Changed in Them\",\"p\":\"Carry participants' testimonies of shifted worship and renewed strength.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA227\",\"IDEA228\",\"IDEA229\",\"IDEA230\"],\"x\":[\"EX037\"],\"top\":[\"TOP055\"]},{\"h\":\"c15s3\",\"t\":\"Healing Already Accomplished\",\"p\":\"State healing as finished and understanding as dimensional.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA243\",\"IDEA244\"],\"x\":[\"EX039\"],\"ref\":[\"REF049\"],\"u\":[\"UNC030\"],\"top\":[\"TOP058\"]},{\"h\":\"c15s4\",\"t\":\"The Sower in One Man\",\"p\":\"Read the parable as stages of growth and charge the shepherd to keep sowing.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA246\",\"IDEA247\",\"IDEA248\",\"IDEA249\"],\"x\":[\"EX041\",\"EX042\"],\"top\":[\"TOP059\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c16\",\"t\":\"Death as Gain\",\"p\":\"Resolve the fear-of-death thread opened in the resurrection chapters.\",\"sum\":\"No fear of death, fear as the devil's old strategy, death as gain lived rather than recited, peaceful departures.\",\"top\":[\"TOP054\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"CONNECT\",\"n\":\"Close the loop with Hebrews 2 on bondage through fear of death.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c16s1\",\"t\":\"To Live Is Christ\",\"p\":\"Convert the doctrine of destroyed death into lived attitude.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA224\",\"IDEA225\",\"IDEA226\",\"IDEA250\",\"IDEA251\",\"IDEA252\"],\"ref\":[\"REF050\",\"REF051\",\"REF056\"],\"top\":[\"TOP054\",\"TOP056\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c17\",\"t\":\"Nothing by Chance\",\"p\":\"Make intentionality the organizing practice: speech, protection, and the responsibility of choice.\",\"sum\":\"Deliberate daily practice, aura of protection, speech correction, poverty as choice not design, balancing warning and promise.\",\"top\":[\"TOP060\",\"TOP061\",\"TOP062\",\"TOP063\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"GROUP\",\"n\":\"Attach the poverty-and-choice exposition to the intentional-living teaching.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c17s1\",\"t\":\"Practice, Not Accident\",\"p\":\"Establish deliberate daily practice, self-monitoring speech, and trust that protects.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA040\",\"IDEA253\",\"IDEA254\",\"IDEA255\",\"IDEA267\",\"IDEA268\"],\"x\":[\"EX043\",\"EX045\"],\"ref\":[\"REF057\"],\"top\":[\"TOP012\",\"TOP060\",\"TOP061\",\"TOP063\"]},{\"h\":\"c17s2\",\"t\":\"God Did Not Make Anyone Poor\",\"p\":\"Work the disputed Proverbs reading and the role of choices and inherited patterns.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA256\",\"IDEA257\",\"IDEA258\",\"IDEA259\",\"IDEA260\",\"IDEA261\",\"IDEA262\",\"IDEA263\",\"IDEA264\",\"IDEA265\"],\"x\":[\"EX044\"],\"ref\":[\"REF053\",\"REF054\"],\"top\":[\"TOP062\"]},{\"h\":\"c17s3\",\"t\":\"The A Part and the B Part\",\"p\":\"Balance warning passages with the promise of life in Christ.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA266\"],\"ref\":[\"REF055\",\"REF052\"],\"top\":[\"TOP060\",\"TOP062\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c18\",\"t\":\"Testimonies of Resurrection\",\"p\":\"Demonstrate the doctrine through resurrection accounts and the humility that must accompany them.\",\"sum\":\"The buried girl raised, activation of what God ordained, the young man raised, a prayer that did not succeed, the vessel's role.\",\"top\":[\"TOP064\",\"TOP065\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"REORDER\",\"n\":\"Place testimony after doctrine and practice so it functions as demonstration.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c18s1\",\"t\":\"The Word That Could Not Fail\",\"p\":\"Carry the prophecy tested by burial and the short prayer at the grave.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA269\",\"IDEA270\",\"IDEA271\",\"IDEA272\"],\"x\":[\"EX046\"],\"ref\":[\"REF041\"],\"top\":[\"TOP064\",\"TOP063\"]},{\"h\":\"c18s2\",\"t\":\"Activation, Not Persuasion\",\"p\":\"Frame miracle as releasing what is already ordained and direct the word rightly.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA273\",\"IDEA274\",\"IDEA275\"],\"ref\":[\"REF058\"],\"top\":[\"TOP064\",\"TOP060\"]},{\"h\":\"c18s3\",\"t\":\"When It Does Not Happen\",\"p\":\"Hold the raised young man beside the woman who died, without softening either.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA276\",\"IDEA277\"],\"x\":[\"EX047\",\"EX048\"],\"top\":[\"TOP064\",\"TOP065\"]},{\"h\":\"c18s4\",\"t\":\"The Vessel, Not the Name\",\"p\":\"Keep results with God rather than with ministerial reputation.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA278\",\"IDEA279\"],\"top\":[\"TOP065\"]}]},{\"h\":\"c19\",\"t\":\"Out of the Eater\",\"p\":\"End with providence that reverses harm and the prophetic vision for the nation.\",\"sum\":\"Stolen Bible turned redemptive, loss treated as seed, declared exponential growth, vision of a transformed nation and a call to pray together.\",\"top\":[\"TOP066\",\"TOP067\"],\"act\":[{\"k\":\"CONNECT\",\"n\":\"Close the book with corporate vision following personal testimony.\"}],\"sections\":[{\"h\":\"c19s1\",\"t\":\"Meant for Evil\",\"p\":\"Carry the providence testimony and the seed-not-bitterness response to loss.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA280\",\"IDEA281\",\"IDEA282\"],\"x\":[\"EX049\"],\"ref\":[\"REF059\"],\"top\":[\"TOP066\",\"TOP062\"]},{\"h\":\"c19s2\",\"t\":\"Angels Over the Nation\",\"p\":\"Close with the prophetic declaration, the national vision, and the call to pray together.\",\"i\":[\"IDEA283\",\"IDEA284\",\"IDEA285\",\"IDEA286\"],\"top\":[\"TOP066\",\"TOP067\",\"TOP060\"]}]}],\"deferred\":[],\"excluded\":[]}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":42770,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":17155,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":5357},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}